eader_tail":"00033a765358"},{"x":6,"y":6,"offset":5234,"count":0,"opaque_header_tail":"00033a765358"},{"x":7,"y":6,"offset":5250,"count":0,"opaque_header_tail":"00033a765358"},{"x":0,"y":7,"offset":5266,"count":0,"opaque_header_tail":"00033a765358"},{"x":1,"y":7,"offset":5282,"count":0,"opaque_header_tail":"00033a765358"},{"x":2,"y":7,"offset":5298,"count":0,"opaque_header_tail":"00033a765358"},{"x":3,"y":7,"offset":5314,"count":0,"opaque_header_tail":"00033a765358"},{"x":4,"y":7,"offset":5330,"count":0,"opaque_header_tail":"00033a765358"},{"x":5,"y":7,"offset":5346,"count":0,"opaque_header_tail":"00033a765358"},{"x":6,"y":7,"offset":5362,"count":0,"opaque_header_tail":"00033a765358"},{"x":7,"y":7,"offset":5378,"count":0,"opaque_header_tail":"00033a765358"}],"id":"other-tundra","name":"Tundra","group":"Other Worlds & examples","bank":"other_worlds_download","source_name":"TUNDRA.DEF","briefing":{"environment":{"sun_angle":1000,"sun_size":180,"sun_colour":13,"gravity":-70,"air_density":8000,"stars":0,"atmosphere_height":13000},"sections":[{"index":0,"text":"X 1000 180 13 -70 8000 0 13000\nTundra (medium)\n  Some rather difficult missions, including \nthe extraordinary fly by remote control \nmission are in this theater.\n  Slightly heavy gravity, and denser\nair make this planet a little different\nthan Earth.","starts":[]},{"index":1,"text":"------------------------------------------------------------------------\n------------------  Welcome to Henderson Field.  -----------------------\n------------------------------------------------------------------------","starts":[]},{"index":2,"text":"------------------------------------------------------------------------\n--------------- Welcome to Dulles International Airport. ---------------\n------------------------------------------------------------------------","starts":[]},{"index":3,"text":"------------------------------------------------------------------------\n-------------------  Welcome to Bubba's Airstrip.  ---------------------\n------------------------------------------------------------------------","starts":[]},{"index":4,"text":"------------------------------------------------------------------------\n-------------------  Welcome to the Weedsport Airport. -----------------\n------------------------------------------------------------------------","starts":[]},{"index":5,"text":"------------------------------------------------------------------------\n----------------- Welcome to RDU ^international Airport ----------------\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nMission:      Through the hoop\nDirection:    North\nDistance:     15 mi\nDifficulty:   6\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n \n  We are attempting to trace the exit point of a portal located to the\nnorth.  Fly through the portal and return to base.  This mission is much\nmore difficult than it looks due to the 4 indestructible generator orbs.\nIt appears they may be attractor-types.\n  This mission can be seen from the airstrip, so take right off and\nfly straight there.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n\nMission:      Radio Ace (Mother of all remote control missions)\nDirection:    WNW\nDistance:     13 mi\nDifficulty:   8\nSxyth 212844 1539831 135422 15404\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n  One of the largest power generating facilities on the planet is \nlocated to the west of our position.  Since all these orbs are the new\nnigh-invulnerable type, up to now we could do nothing about it.\n  Recently, the aliens have placed an airstrip near there with more than\na half-dozen captured planes for evaluation.  Your mission is to fly in\nthere, land, and then take out all the indestrucible orbs by crashing\nthe planes into the orbs.\n  There is a platform about 1/2 way down the airstrip which would be \nideal for remote control flying.  You are to proceed to the end of the\nairstrip, enter a plane, taxi it to a good starting position, and then\nexit it and walk back to the platform.  Then take off in the plane via\nremote control (caps lock), and crash it into the orbs, on at a time.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMission:      Icarus\nDirection:    East\nDistance:     13 mi\nDifficulty:   3\nSxyth -696493 -1609971 568628 40756\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n  Some generator orbs are trying a new defense.  Three of them are \nsuspended at 34,000 feet in an attempt to get beyond our flight ceiling.\nUse whatever means available to you to get up there and blow those \nsuckers up.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMission:      The Hot Box\nDirection:    North East\nDistance:     13 mi\nDifficulty:   5\nSxyth 162538 -1671000 142413 48738\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n  There is a gathering of enemy forces to the north east of here.  Go\ntake out all the KLA and AA sites.  Beware of the suspended orbs.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMission:      Suspended Insanity\nDirection:    West\nDistance:     12 mi\nDifficulty:   2\nSxyth -1289461 2067056 101379 7369\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n  A mindbender is located near a suspended airstrip.  This MB must be\ntaken out with an assassin bomb planted while on foot.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\nMission:      Saucer Frenzy\nDirection:    South\nDistance:     9 mi\nDifficulty:   6\nSxyth -1714482 672818 129487 39508\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n  The saucer sites are producing waves of saucers which are devastating\nour airfields.  Take out all the saucers and their sites.  Take out the\nhigh quality site first, or else you may end up in trouble.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n\nMission:      Michael get your bush down\nDirection:    South East\nDistance:     13 mi\nDifficulty:   5\nSxyth -2061918 -1421547 192322 31812\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n  Some suspended tofu is causing havoc with our communications.  Take\nout all the TRFRU, and beware of the indestructible orb. \n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------","starts":[{"position_cm":[212844,1539831,135422],"yaw":15404,"name":"Start 1"},{"position_cm":[-696493,-1609971,568628],"yaw":40756,"name":"Start 2"},{"position_cm":[162538,-1671000,142413],"yaw":48738,"name":"Start 3"},{"position_cm":[-1289461,2067056,101379],"yaw":7369,"name":"Start 4"},{"position_cm":[-1714482,672818,129487],"yaw":39508,"name":"Start 5"},{"position_cm":[-2061918,-1421547,192322],"yaw":31812,"name":"Start 6"}]},{"index":6,"text":"------------------------------------------------------------------------\n-------------- Welcome to Crickety Point Landing Strip. ----------------\n------------------------------------------------------------------------","starts":[]},{"index":7,"text":"------------------------------------------------------------------------\n------------ Welcome to Sweetly Bending Oak Aircraft Park. -------------\n------------------------------------------------------------------------","starts":[]},{"index":8,"text":"------------------------------------------------------------------------\n-------- Welcome to Easter Island Municipal Air Travel Center. ---------\n------------------------------------------------------------------------","starts":[]},{"index":9,"text":"------------------------------------------------------------------------\n--- This airport has been recently captured and has no name as yet. ----\n---------------------------------